1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,945
Yawn.

2
00:00:00,945 --> 00:00:01,940
A big one.

3
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,567
Your ears RUMBLE, right?

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,640
Congrats.

5
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,567
You just flexed your EAR.

6
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,800
Now do it WITHOUT the yawn.

7
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,467
Up to half of you can.

8
00:00:11,498 --> 00:00:12,410
The rest...

9
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:14,167
just pulled a weird face.

10
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:16,620
That muscle pulls your eardrum tight...

11
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,667
like a drum.

12
00:00:17,718 --> 00:00:19,030
Sound went muffled?

13
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,110
It's a volume knob,

14
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:21,733
for your own chewing.

15
00:00:21,797 --> 00:00:22,973
Scientists are testing it

16
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:24,990
so people who can barely move...

17
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:27,067
can type with a rumble.

18
00:00:27,170 --> 00:00:28,170
Go on.

19
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:30,356
Rumble twice for yes.

